<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Lake Elsinore Sch Fin Auth, Calif.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Lake Elsinore Sch Fin Auth, Calif.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K. Baum &amp; Co. said it received the written award for the $6.930 million of Lake Elsinore School Financing Authority, Calif., 1997 revenue bonds with a top yield of 6.25 percent in 2019.</p>
